flowchart LR
    A[Business question] --> B[Acquire data]
    B --> C[Clean: missing, outliers, types]
    C --> D[Exploratory data analysis]
    D --> E[Feature engineering]
    E --> F[Model or statistical test]
    F --> G[Evaluate against metric]
    G --> H{Answers the question?}
    H -- No --> D
    H -- Yes --> I[Communicate: viz and narrative]
    I --> J[Decision or A/B test]
    J -- new questions --> A
